  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organization of the FoodGuard Global Summit 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FoodGuard Global Summit 2026 is a UNIDO#Informa Markets partnership event in Cairo, Egypt (2-4 June2026) designed to accelerate practical solutions to reduce food loss and waste (FLW) through policy convergence, packaging/ingredient innovation, digital transformation, and investment facilitation across Africa and the Middle East. The summit combines ministerial-level dialogue with hands#on workshops, an innovation zone, and dealmaking activities, targeting measurable outcomes linked to SDGs 2, 9 and 12.</narrative>
  </description>
